# (AI-assisted) profiling pad (docs/3ds-port/jak2_perf.md): Haven City slums, stand + walk windows; platform/3ds/tools/sample_run.sh turns no-sync on inside them
1000 continue ctysluma-start
1001 -
1002 wait *target* target-stance
1003 log city: ctysluma-start
1004 pos *target*
1400 print *pad-script-mem*
1401 log perf-mark stand
31400 log perf-mark stand-end
31401 log perf-mark walk
31402 ly=0
37400 -
37401 log perf-mark walk-end
37402 pos *target*
37500 exit
